# New process, same resident graph and saved deck snapshots.
wait
advance
wait
assert snap fields == 2
assert snap readings == 1
assert snap reflections == 1
assert text number: 8
assert text What can I meet patiently?
reveal key typed-card typed-card
settle 2
capture reopened-typed-card
reveal key crosswalk crosswalk:cleromancy.tarot/marseille-complete-reflective-v1
settle 2
assert visible key crosswalk crosswalk:cleromancy.tarot/marseille-complete-reflective-v1
c3-crosswalk
settle 2
assert text number: 11
reveal key typed-card typed-card
settle 2
capture reopened-crosswalk
reveal key crosswalk return-drawn-card
settle 2
assert visible key crosswalk return-drawn-card
c3-return
settle 2
assert text number: 8
